{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"de Rham 定理"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"deRham定理"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>陈述</h2>\n<p>设 $X$ 为实流形, 则常值层 $\\mathbb{R}$ 的 "},{"Local":{"url":"层上同调","text":"层上同调"}},{"Plain":"可由 "},{"Local":{"url":"deRham上同调","text":"de Rham 上同调"}},{"Plain":"计算:\n$$\r\nH^p(X, \\mathbb{R}) \\simeq H^p_{dR}(X).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>证明</h2>\n<p>考虑 $p$-形式层 $\\mathcal A^p$, 则有常值层 $\\mathbb{R}$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"细层","text":"细层"}},{"Plain":"消解\n$$\r\n0 \\to \\mathbb{R} \\to \\mathcal A^0 \\to \\mathcal A^1 \\to \\cdots\r\n$$\n(其正合性是由于 "},{"Local":{"url":"Poincaré引理","text":"Poincaré 引理"}},{"Plain":"), 故由细层消解的性质,\n$$\r\nH^p(X,\\mathbb{R}) \\simeq H^p(\\Gamma(\\mathcal A^\\bullet)).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Hodge理论","text":"Hodge 理论"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"Dolbeault上同调","text":"Dolbeault 上同调"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}